# Example: How your credentials.md should look

Below is an example of a completed credentials file. 
**DO NOT commit this file with real credentials!**

---

# Site Credentials

- **Site URL**: https://demo.example.com
- **Login Page**: https://demo.example.com/auth/login
- **Application Name**: demo_app
- **Username**: demo_user@example.com
- **Password**: MySecurePassword123!

## Additional Notes

This is a demo site for testing the web agent system.

### Special Instructions:
- The site uses email as username
- 2FA is not enabled for this test account
- Session timeout is 30 minutes

### Test Commands:
Once logged in, you can try these commands:
- "search for products"
- "click on my profile"
- "view recent orders"
